@* 🟢 يقابل Accounts.BeautyCenter.FrmInvoiceCreate (فاتورة مركز التجميل من حجز): تُعرَض خدمات/منتجات الحجز بخانة اختيار
   لما يُراد تفويته، ونقدى/آجل، والحفظ عبر نفس InvoiceBeautyCLS.SaveInvoiceAndLinkServices (الذى يبنى الفاتورة بـ
   MapInvoices ثم يستدعى المحرك القياسى Requests_ModelCls.Make_Invoice_Update_CustomerAccount ويربط AppointmentServices
   بالفاتورة) - بدون أى تعديل فى كود المحرك أو سطح المكتب. لا حقول static (الأصل بلا static).

   ملاحظة عن الأصل: زر الحفظ فى شاشة الويندوز الحالية (btnSaveInvoice_Click_1) يفحص قائمة selectedDetails المُنشأة فارغة
   دائماً فيعرض التنبيه ويعود قبل استدعاء المحرك، أى أن الحفظ معطَّل فعلياً هناك (ومدخل القائمة الرئيسية يفتحها بـ
   appointmentId=1 مكتوباً يدوياً)؛ هذه الصفحة تنفّذ القصد الواضح للأصل (اختيار الخدمات ثم استدعاء المحرك) وتستبعد
   الخدمات المفوترة سابقاً كى لا تُفوتَر مرتين (الأصل يخلط "مُحدَّد" و"مفوتر" فى نفس الحقل IsProcessedAsInvoice). *@

@page "/accounts/beauty/invoice-create/{AppointmentId:long}"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountModelsLib.Models
@using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject ISnackbar Snackbar
@inject NavigationManager Nav

<PageTitle>@Tr("BC_Title")</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4 inv-page" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">

    <MudPaper Class="inv-card mb-4" Elevation="0">
        <h1 class="inv-title" style="margin-bottom:16px">@Tr("BC_Title")</h1>

        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_loadError))
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error">@_loadError</MudAlert>
        }
        else if (_notFound)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error">@Tr("BC_NotFound")</MudAlert>
        }
        else if (_appointment is not null)
        {
            <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="4" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Wrap="Wrap.Wrap">
                <MudText>@Tr("BC_AppointmentInfo") #@_appointment.Id</MudText>
                <MudText>@Tr("CustomerLabel"): @_appointment.Customer?.Name</MudText>
                <MudText>@_appointment.AppointmentDate?.ToString("yyyy/MM/dd HH:mm")</MudText>
                <MudRadioGroup T="int" @bind-Value="_isAgile" Disabled="_savedInvoiceId > 0">
                    <MudRadio T="int" Value="0" Color="Color.Primary">@Tr("DS_InvoiceCash")</MudRadio>
                    <MudRadio T="int" Value="1" Color="Color.Primary">@Tr("DS_InvoiceCredit")</MudRadio>
                </MudRadioGroup>
            </MudStack>
        }
    </MudPaper>

    @if (_appointment is not null)
    {
        <MudPaper Class="inv-card mb-4" Elevation="0">
            <MudTable Items="@_rows" Hover="true" Elevation="0" Class="inv-table">
                <HeaderContent>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("DS_SelectColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("BC_ServiceColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("UnitPriceColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("QuantityColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("DS_ValueColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("BC_DurationColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("BC_EmployeesColumn")</MudTh>
                    <MudTh>@Tr("BC_InvoicedColumn")</MudTh>
                </HeaderContent>
                <RowTemplate>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DS_SelectColumn")">
                        <MudCheckBox T="bool" Value="context.Selected" ValueChanged="@(v => context.Selected = v)"
                                     Disabled="@(context.Invoiced || _savedInvoiceId > 0)" Dense="true" />
                    </MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("BC_ServiceColumn")">@context.Service.ServiceItem_Name</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("UnitPriceColumn")">@context.Service.S_Price?.ToString("0.00")</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("QuantityColumn")">@context.Service.Qnty?.ToString("0.##")</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("DS_ValueColumn")">@context.LineTotal.ToString("0.00")</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("BC_DurationColumn")">@context.Service.DurationMinutes</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("BC_EmployeesColumn")">@context.Service.EmployeeNames</MudTd>
                    <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("BC_InvoicedColumn")">@(context.Invoiced ? Tr("DS_StatusInvoiced") : Tr("DS_StatusNotInvoiced"))</MudTd>
                </RowTemplate>
                <NoRecordsContent>
                    <MudText Align="Align.Center" Class="py-4 mud-text-secondary">@Tr("NoItemsMessage")</MudText>
                </NoRecordsContent>
            </MudTable>
        </MudPaper>

        <MudPaper Class="inv-card mb-4" Elevation="0">
            <MudGrid Spacing="3">
                <MudItem xs="6" sm="3">
                    <MudTextField T="string" Value="@SelectedTotal.ToString("0.00")" ReadOnly="true" Label="@Tr("TotalLabel")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" />
                </MudItem>
            </MudGrid>
        </MudPaper>

        <MudStack Row="true" Justify="Justify.FlexEnd" Spacing="2">
            @if (_savedInvoiceId > 0)
            {
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Href="@($"/accounts/invoices/sales-invoice/{_savedInvoiceId}")">@Tr("BC_OpenInvoice")</MudButton>
            }
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Disabled="_savedInvoiceId > 0 || !_rows.Any(r => r.Selected && !r.Invoiced)"
                       OnClick="SaveAsync">@Tr("SaveButton")</MudButton>
        </MudStack>
    }

</MudContainer>

@code {
    private sealed class ServiceRow
    {
        public AppointmentService Service { get; init; } = default!;
        public bool Selected { get; set; }
        // 🟢 "مفوتر" = ارتبطت بفاتورة فعلاً (الأصل يستخدم IsProcessedAsInvoice للأمرين معاً؛ هنا نفصلهما).
        public bool Invoiced => Service.IsProcessedAsInvoice == 1 || (Service.Invoices_List_Id ?? 0) > 0;
        public decimal LineTotal => (Service.S_Price ?? 0) * (Service.Qnty ?? 1);
    }

    [Parameter] public long AppointmentId { get; set; }
    [SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "serviceId")] public long? ServiceIdQuery { get; set; }

    private readonly AccountModelsLib.operations _opp = new();
    private Appointment? _appointment;
    private List<ServiceRow> _rows = new();
    private bool _notFound;
    private string? _loadError;
    private int _isAgile = 1;
    private long _savedInvoiceId;

    private decimal SelectedTotal => _rows.Where(r => r.Selected && !r.Invoiced).Sum(r => r.LineTotal);

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        // 🟢 يقابل LoadInvoiceData: جلب الحجز مع خدماته والعميل، وفلترة خدمة واحدة لو مُرِّر serviceId.
        try
        {
            _appointment = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                return _opp.db.Appointments.AsNoTracking()
                    .Include(a => a.appointmentService)
                    .Include(a => a.Customer)
                    .FirstOrDefault(a => a.Id == AppointmentId);
            });
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            // 🟢 مثلاً اختلاف مخطط قاعدة البيانات عن نموذج EF (عمود ناقص فى AppointmentServices) - نعرضه بدل صفحة 500.
            _loadError = ex.Message;
            return;
        }

        if (_appointment is null) { _notFound = true; return; }

        var services = _appointment.appointmentService.Where(s => s.AppointmentId == _appointment.Id);
        if (ServiceIdQuery.HasValue) services = services.Where(s => s.Id == ServiceIdQuery.Value);
        _rows = services.Select(s => new ServiceRow { Service = s, Selected = false }).ToList();
        foreach (var r in _rows.Where(r => !r.Invoiced)) r.Selected = true;
    }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        var chosen = _rows.Where(r => r.Selected && !r.Invoiced).ToList();
        if (chosen.Count == 0) { Snackbar.Add(Tr("BC_SelectServicesError"), Severity.Warning); return; }

        // 🟢 يقابل UpdateRowLineTotal + تعليم المختار IsProcessedAsInvoice=1 (المحرك يتجاهل ما قيمته 0).
        foreach (var r in chosen)
        {
            r.Service.QntyValue = r.LineTotal;
            r.Service.IsProcessedAsInvoice = 1;
        }
        var toInvoice = chosen.Select(r => r.Service).ToList();

        var excp = 0;
        var msg = "";
        long invoiceId = 0;
        string? swallowed = null;
        EventHandler<System.Runtime.ExceptionServices.FirstChanceExceptionEventArgs> handler = (_, e) =>
        {
            var name = e.Exception.GetType().Name;
            if (name.Contains("Sql") || name.Contains("DbUpdate") || name.Contains("Invalid") || name.Contains("Null"))
            {
                swallowed = e.Exception.Message;
                var frames = string.Join(" <- ", Environment.StackTrace.Split((char)10).Skip(3).Take(8).Select(s => s.Trim()));
                Console.Error.WriteLine($"[BeautyInvoice.Save] {e.Exception.GetType().FullName}: {e.Exception.Message} @ {frames}");
            }
        };
        try
        {
            AppDomain.CurrentDomain.FirstChanceException += handler;
            invoiceId = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                var cls = new InvoiceBeautyCLS();
                return cls.SaveInvoiceAndLinkServices(ref excp, ref msg, _isAgile, _appointment!, toInvoice, _opp);
            });
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            foreach (var r in chosen) r.Service.IsProcessedAsInvoice = 0;
            Snackbar.Add(ex.Message, Severity.Error);
            return;
        }
        finally
        {
            AppDomain.CurrentDomain.FirstChanceException -= handler;
        }

        if (excp == 0)
        {
            _savedInvoiceId = invoiceId;
            foreach (var r in chosen) r.Service.Invoices_List_Id = invoiceId;
            Snackbar.Add(Tr("BC_Saved"), Severity.Success);
        }
        else
        {
            foreach (var r in chosen) r.Service.IsProcessedAsInvoice = 0;
            var detail = string.IsNullOrEmpty(msg) ? swallowed : msg;
            Snackbar.Add(string.IsNullOrEmpty(detail) ? Tr("InvoiceSaveError") : $"{Tr("InvoiceSaveError")}: {detail}", Severity.Error);
        }
    }

    private string Tr(string key)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
